{
  "_doc": "E2E secrets + fixtures TEMPLATE. Copy to ~/.cherry-e2e/secrets.local.json (repo-external) and fill real values. NEVER commit real keys / endpoints / absolute paths. Runner resolution: ${secrets.X} -> first provider in activeProviders[domain] that defines X ; ${fixtures.X} -> fixtures.X . A null/missing secret makes steps that reference it skip-if-absent (e.g. rerankModelId).",

